  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture, Beneficiaries:50 members are beneficiaries, comprising of 7 men and 43 women. , The project funds will be used to enable the organization to purchase steers for fattening and selling purpose. In addition, they will receive office equipment and capacity building in record keeping, proper documentation and filling.</narrative>
